; rejected-by: T-outcome
; docs/ir-specification.md section 4.1. "unknown" is the v1 request alphabet
; (system.py:126-128); a v2 history uses the capcov.faults alphabet ok / fail
; / info. The bridge (section 7) maps unknown to info under atomic-publish-v1;
; it never appears in a v2 history.
[history
 [[open]
  [invoke "i1" "send" [["id" "j"]]] [complete "i1" [unknown]]
  [close]]]
